WEBVTT

00:05:30.201 --> 00:05:32.203
The same is true for creators.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.038
Today ...

00:05:34.914 --> 00:05:36.082
Whoo.

00:05:36.082 --> 00:05:40.169
We’re on the precipice
of an entirely new internet,

00:05:40.169 --> 00:05:44.548
built on fundamentally different
technology than the tools of yesterday.

00:05:44.548 --> 00:05:47.718
New technology
is making new ideas possible.

00:05:48.636 --> 00:05:51.430
Cryptocurrencies, social tokens,
nonfungible tokens,

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.682
decentralized autonomous organizations --

00:05:53.682 --> 00:05:55.601
that one really rolls off the tongue --

00:05:55.601 --> 00:05:57.520
smart contracts --

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:01.690
these are a group of ideas
known in the industry as web3.